	(text "Animatronic eyes carrier: D1 Mini ESP32 + PCA9685 + LM2596 on one milled board, M3 standoffs into the rack.\nPower: 12 V pigtail -> J1 -> LM2596 (set 5.0-5.1 V unloaded, USB unplugged) -> +5V.\n+5V is star-routed on the board: separate traces from U3 OUT+ to U2 V+ and to U1 VCC (pin 35).\nC1/C2 hang on the +5V run to U1 pin 35. R1/R2 divide the PCA V+ rail to GPIO36 (ADC1_CH0) for the rail monitor (Rail.cpp PIN=36, DIVIDER=2).\nU2 rows are internally paralleled (jumper pad groups on the footprint): +5V feeds the right V+ from the buck and the left V+ feeds the divider.\nI2C is on IO25 (SDA) / IO27 (SCL), not 21/22: single-sided routing can only reach the OUTER header columns. Wire.begin(25, 27).\nU1 pin numbers = header positions per r0oland ESP32_mini; VERIFY against the board silk before cutting."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 38.1 215.9 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.6 1.6)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "4a3b0cd1-1e03-56ba-94ce-6c990fa90a22")
	)
